  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Protostar.UI::ActionBindingText
  textMesh: {fileID: 1244376260}
  message: "Welcome to the collector\u2019s den of your mentor. Here they keep objects
    and souvenirs from their many travels.\r\n\r\nThe second step to creating a world
    is the spice of life itself. You are sure that the strange creature floating
    in the water tank you\u2019ve stared at for hours will have this life and spice!
    You just need to find it."
