  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Protostar.UI::ActionBindingText
  textMesh: {fileID: 1409123656}
  message: "You are now standing in your mentor\u2019s lab. Better be careful not
    to knock over anything; they have done a lot of strange experimentation you don\u2019t
    understand here!\r\n\r\nThe final step to creating a world is technology and
    culture. Your mentor built a control board from scratch somewhere in this place.
    They always told you they made it with the tech methods of their culture in mind!\r\n"
